<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="overmapsearch.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="overmapsearch">
    <!-- Tier 6 slice 2: the overmap search result box (overmap_ui::search). A small
         top-right box stacked over the legend doc; the body is transparent so the
         overmap shows through. Render-only: search term / result count / direction
         (top) + cycle/confirm/quit hints (bottom). Keyboard owns NEXT/PREV/CONFIRM/
         QUIT. The search term itself is entered via a Tier-0 string_input popup. -->
    <div class="panel oms-box">
        <div class="oms-body" data-rml="body_rml"></div>
        <div class="oms-hints" data-rml="hints_rml"></div>
    </div>
    <div id="crt-overlay" class="crt"></div>
</body>
</rml>
